type: software

title: "SymNet: Symbolic Multi Layer Perceptron based DSL Compiler for Group-Theoretic Boolean Expressions"
abstract: "SymNet is a high-performance domain-specific compiler and native C++ SIMD runtime engine that translates symbolic algebraic group operations and continuous Lie manifold phasors into constant-time O(1) zero-branch linear tensor execution graphs."

